"to work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem pib tmate SSH kev sib ntsib thiab tau "
"txais SSH txoj hlua nkag los ntawm kev xa cov lus zais SMS. TOTP yog qhov "
"yuav tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab "
"teeb tsa lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP' Real "
"life example: 'Gorilla 123456'"

#: /home/alaraajavamma/claude/telephony/src/telephony/ui/windows/trusted_actions_list_window.py:185
msgid ""
"Trusted contacts can wipe your device. TOTP is mandatory for this feature to "
"work. Add contacts below and set their secret trigger phrase. Example "
"template: 'SECRET TOTP SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Real life "
"example: 'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"
msgstr ""
"Cov neeg uas ntseeg siab tuaj yeem so koj lub cuab yeej. TOTP yog qhov yuav "
"tsum tau ua rau qhov no ua haujlwm. Ntxiv cov neeg hauv qab no thiab teeb "
"tsa lawv cov kab lus zais cia. Piv txwv template: 'SECRET TOTP "
"SIM_CURRENT_PIN SIM_NEW_PIN SUDO_PASSWORD' Lub neej tiag tiag piv txwv: "
"'Gorilla 123456 0000 1234 SupportYourLocalFootball'"

